const smallNumbers=['cero','uno','dos','tres','cuatro','cinco','seis','siete','ocho','nueve','diez','once','doce','trece','catorce','quince','dieciséis','diecisiete','dieciocho','diecinueve','veinte','veintiuno','veintidós','veintitrés','veinticuatro','veinticinco','veintiséis','veintisiete','veintiocho','veintinueve'];
function numberWordsUnderThousand(value){const n=Math.floor(value);if(n<30)return smallNumbers[n];if(n<100){const tens=['','','','treinta','cuarenta','cincuenta','sesenta','setenta','ochenta','noventa'],unit=n%10;return`${tens[Math.floor(n/10)]}${unit?` y ${smallNumbers[unit]}`:''}`}if(n===100)return'cien';const hundreds=['','ciento','doscientos','trescientos','cuatrocientos','quinientos','seiscientos','setecientos','ochocientos','novecientos'],rest=n%100;return`${hundreds[Math.floor(n/100)]}${rest?` ${numberWordsUnderThousand(rest)}`:''}`}
function numberWordsEs(value){const n=Math.max(0,Math.floor(Number(value)||0));if(n<1000)return numberWordsUnderThousand(n);if(n<1000000){const thousands=Math.floor(n/1000),rest=n%1000;return`${thousands===1?'mil':`${numberWordsUnderThousand(thousands)} mil`}${rest?` ${numberWordsUnderThousand(rest)}`:''}`}const millions=Math.floor(n/1000000),rest=n%1000000;return`${millions===1?'un millón':`${numberWordsEs(millions)} millones`}${rest?` ${numberWordsEs(rest)}`:''}`}
